# AdOpt

> AdOpt is a Consent Management Platform (CMP) that helps websites comply with 40+ global data protection laws, including GDPR, LGPD, and CCPA. It provides a customizable cookie consent banner, automatic tag/cookie scanning, encrypted consent logs, and automatic generation of privacy documents.

AdOpt delivers prior blocking of tags, granular per-purpose consent, and cross-site (consent network) synchronization so a single banner can serve multiple domains. It integrates natively with Google Consent Mode and Google Tag Manager, and offers white-label, teams/organizations, and a full audit trail to prove compliance. A full developer API reference is available to customers on request. AdOpt serves publishers, agencies, and enterprises — from a 30-day free trial to white-label Enterprise — with support for 40+ languages and jurisdictions across the EU, Brazil, and the US.

