## Features

- [Tag Scanner](https://goadopt.io/en/features/tag-scanner/): Detects cookies and trackers running on a site and maps them to consent purposes.
- [Authenticated Scan](https://goadopt.io/en/features/authenticated-scan/): Scans pages behind login to find tags that load only for authenticated users.
- [Advanced Customization](https://goadopt.io/en/features/advanced-customization/): Controls the design, appearance, and behavior of the consent banner.
- [Multi Regulations](https://goadopt.io/en/features/multi-regulations/): Covers 40+ international data protection laws, including GDPR, LGPD, and CCPA.
- [Google Consent Mode](https://goadopt.io/en/features/google-consent-mode/): Sends consent signals natively to Google tags.
- [Google Tag Manager](https://goadopt.io/en/features/google-tag-manager/): Triggers GTM tags based on user consent.
- [Cross-site Consent](https://goadopt.io/en/features/cross-site-consent/): Synchronizes a single consent across multiple domains via a consent network.
- [Consent Reset](https://goadopt.io/en/features/consent-reset/): Re-collects consent from users when key configuration changes (e.g. policy or banner-text updates); stores all consents by version.
- [Documents Generator](https://goadopt.io/en/features/documents-generator/): Generates privacy policy and related legal documents automatically.
- [Privacy Hub](https://goadopt.io/en/features/privacy-portal/): Manages data subject requests and privacy-rights fulfillment.
- [DPO Notifications](https://goadopt.io/en/features/dpo-notifications/): Alerts the Data Protection Officer about relevant compliance events.
- [Audit Logs](https://goadopt.io/en/features/audit-logs/): Records immutable activity and encrypted consent logs to prove compliance.
- [Dashboard](https://goadopt.io/en/features/dashboard/): Tracks consent KPIs and metrics.
- [Callbacks and APIs](https://goadopt.io/en/features/callbacks-api/): Connects external systems through integration endpoints and callbacks.
- [Teams and Organizations](https://goadopt.io/en/features/teams-organizations/): Manages role-based access for teams and organizations.
- [White Label](https://goadopt.io/en/features/white-label/): Rebrands the platform and banner for agencies and resellers.

